ass="block text-xs text-stone-500">'.e($c['description']).' · '.($c['is_active']?'Live':'Hidden').'</small></div><a class="text-xs underline" href="'.aurl($tenant,'coupons',['edit'=>$c['id']]).'">Edit</a><form method="post">'.csrf_input().'<input type="hidden" name="action" value="coupon_delete"><input type="hidden" name="id" value="'.$c['id'].'"><button class="text-xs text-red-600">Delete</button></form></article>';echo '</div></div>';}
if($page==='storefront'){echo '<h2 class="text-2xl font-bold">Storefront settings</h2><p class="mt-1 text-sm text-stone-600">Customize every global visual and content setting.</p><form class="mt-7 max-w-3xl rounded-xl bg-white p-5 shadow-sm" method="post" enctype="multipart/form-data">'.csrf_input().'<input type="hidden" name="action" value="store_save"><div class="grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2"><label class="text-xs font-bold">Store name<input required name="name" value="'.e($tenant['name']).'" class="mt-1 w-full border p-2"></label><label class="text-xs font-bold">Tagline<input name="tagline" value="'.e($tenant['tagline']).'" class="mt-1 w-full border p-2"></label></div><label class="mt-3 block text-xs font-bold">Brand story<textarea name="description" class="mt-1 w-full border p-2">'.e($tenant['description']).'</textarea></label><label class="mt-3 block text-xs font-bold">Hero headline<input name="hero_title" value="'.e($tenant['hero_title']).'" class="mt-1 w-full border p-2"></label><div class="mt-3 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2"><label class="text-xs font-bold">Logo upload<input type="file" name="logo" accept="image/*" class="mt-1 w-full text-xs"></label><label class="text-xs font-bold">Logo URL<input name="logo_url" class="mt-1 w-full border p-2"></label><label class="text-xs font-bold">Hero upload<input type="file" name="hero" accept="image/*" class="mt-1 w-full text-xs"></label><label class="text-xs font-bold">Hero URL<input name="hero_url" class="mt-1 w-full border p-2"></label></div><fieldset class="mt-5"><legend class="text-xs font-bold">Theme</legend><div class="mt-2 grid grid-cols-2 gap-2 sm:grid-cols-4">';foreach(['minimal','neomorphism','skeuomorphism','glassmorphism','claymorphism','maximalism','brutalism'] as $theme)echo '<label class="rounded border p-2 text-xs"><input class="mr-1" type="radio" name="theme" value="'.$theme.'" '.($tenant['theme']===$theme?'checked':'').'>'.ucfirst($theme).'</label>';echo '</div></fieldset><div class="mt-4 grid grid-cols-3 gap-3"><label class="text-xs font-bold">Primary<input name="primary_color" value="'.e($tenant['primary_color']).'" class="mt-1 w-full border p-2"></label><label class="text-xs font-bold">Surface<input name="secondary_color" value="'.e($tenant['secondary_color']).'" class="mt-1 w-full border p-2"></label><label class="text-xs font-bold">Accent<input name="accent_color" value="'.e($tenant['accent_color']).'" class="mt-1 w-full border p-2"></label></div><label class="mt-4 inline-flex text-xs"><input class="mr-2" type="checkbox" name="show_brand_name" '.($tenant['show_brand_name']?'checked':'').'>Show brand name beside uploaded logo</label><button class="mt-5 rounded bg-zinc-900 px-5 py-3 text-sm font-bold text-white">Save storefront</button></form>';}
if($page==='orders'){echo '<h2 class="text-2xl font-bold">Orders & delivery</h2><p class="mt-1 text-sm text-stone-600">Order records are ready for Shiprocket creation and tracking.</p><div class="mt-7 overflow-auto rounded-xl bg-white shadow-sm">';$s=$db->prepare('SELECT * FROM orders WHERE tenant_id=? ORDER BY id DESC');$s->execute([$tenant['id']]);foreach($s->fetchAll() as $o)echo '<form method="post" class="grid min-w-[620px] grid-cols-[1fr_auto_9rem_9rem_auto] gap-3 border-b p-4">'.csrf_input().'<input type="hidden" name="action" value="order_status"><input type="hidden" name="id" value="'.$o['id'].'"><div><b class="text-sm">'.e($o['order_number']).'</b><small class="block text-xs text-stone-500">'.e($o['customer_name']).' · '.e($o['awb_code']).'</small></div><b class="text-sm">'.money((float)$o['total']).'</b><select name="payment_status" class="border p-2 text-xs"><option '.($o['payment_status']==='pending'?'selected':'').'>pending</option><option '.($o['payment_status']==='paid'?'selected':'').'>paid</option></select><select name="order_status" class="border p-2 text-xs">';foreach(['new','processing','shipped','delivered','cancelled'] as $status)echo '<option '.($o['order_status']===$status?'selected':'').'>'.$status.'</option>';echo '</select><button class="text-xs font-bold text-violet-700">Save</button></form>';echo '</div>';}
